<title>UK: Brent dates kept by equity holder and trader.</title>
<headline>Brent dates kept by equity holder and trader.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Brent dates which turned wet by the five o'clock deadline were kept by an equity producer and a trader, traders said.</p>
<p>Esso kept one Oct 17-19 cargo and Phibro kept the other.</p>
<p>An October 16-18 Brent cargo was sold on Wednesday at November paper flat.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
</text>
